#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — first warning body, disk with partitions AND data
msgid ""
"**{DEVICE}** contains **partitions with existing data**.\n"
"\n"
"If you confirm, Recalbox will **permanently and irreversibly**:\n"
"\n"
"- Erase **all partitions** on this disk\n"
"- **Destroy all data** present on those partitions\n"
"\n"
"**There is no going back.** Once confirmed, there is absolutely "
"no way to recover your files or partitions.\n"
"\n"
"Are you **absolutely sure** you want to continue?"
msgstr ""

#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — first warning body, disk with partitions but no detected data
msgid ""
"**{DEVICE}** already has partitions.\n"
"\n"
"If you confirm, Recalbox will **permanently and irreversibly "
"erase all existing partitions** on this disk.\n"
"\n"
"**There is no going back.**\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""

